  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Scholar Whisperwind and I are attempting to piece together a map of this world. The data is somewhat lacking.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-BALE_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1727094,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You ain't kidding. The Bales did a partial flyby as they came in for a landing... although they're not on land. A sea-ing? Anyway...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-BALE_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1727095,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There are scattered islands and ruined cities all over. We were charting their positions when-",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_NomadF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Neta_Wayfinder_AH-BALE_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Boom! Shellions! And now all their notes and sketches and maths and protractors and charts and things are scattered all over.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-BALE_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1727095,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Fortunately, we brought a Regeneratrix that we can use to repair their map if we can find the Missing Pieces.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-BALE_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1727094,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Which won't be easy because... there's a BIRD!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-BALE_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1727095,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "A large bird took some of the pieces to its nest in one of the ruined buildings. Our Troopers are marshalling to pursue it...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_NomadF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Neta_Wayfinder_AH-BALE_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...But they are still counting our losses, who was taken, how many ships. Can't set sail without a head count.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_NomadF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Neta_Wayfinder_AH-BALE_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I expect the Wizard can handle this more quickly. Find the Map Pieces around the Flotilla and in the Bird Nest and bring them back here.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-BALE_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1727094,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
